  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: tutorial_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5743c65efc6ea2b44a36caee208246ec, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 125375078400
    m_Localized: "Hi! I'm Neve \u2014 your assistent. Our goal is to establish uninterrapred
      operation of the nuclear power plant."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2730079805440
    m_Localized: Use WASD or arrows to move around the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2863341232128
    m_Localized: If you'll have questions, follow the tab with question mark on the
      task panel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6439400628224
    m_Localized: Firstly, let's enable the reactor. Press once with the left mouse
      button on the reactor. It's that big thing with colorful squares in the center
      of the power plant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6441283870720
    m_Localized: "While reactor is working, we're producing our main currency \u2014
      Energy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6443108392960
    m_Localized: Be careful, watch the reactor's temperature. If it's too high, you
      get penalty to the Energy production. You need to disable the reactor to cool
      it down. Press on the reactor once again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9530900471808
    m_Localized: Got the energy? Good! Now you can build a new module. Press on the
      cooler at the right of the reactor and build it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10829847060480
    m_Localized: Meowesome! Now you can click on the cooler to drop the temperature
      of reactor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11770012884992
    m_Localized: Our lights went out! It means the Generator in the top left corner
      run out of the power, that supports modules operation!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12702549270528
    m_Localized: 'Important rule: Watch the generator. Click the right mouse button
      on the generator building multiple times to power it up, until lights turned
      on again. But you always can power up the generator on full.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13636423639040
    m_Localized: You bought Turbine! Wait until turbine is charged up and press on
      it. It will give you a powerful boost to the energy production on short time
      without temperature increase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15182125326336
    m_Localized: Time to automate the operation! We unlocked the Specialist Headquarter! 
      Here you can buy and place specialists on modules, so they can do your routine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15500309422080
    m_Localized: 'On the Task Panel you have two tabs: recruiting window to search
      new employees and employee management window to place them on modules.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
